## To Run in Production

```bash
# Set environment variables
export GEMINI_API_KEY="your-key"
export TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN="your-token"
export TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID="your-chat-id"

# Run orchestrator (daily at 8 AM)
crontab -e
0 8 * * * /path/to/scripts/run_orchestrator.sh

# Run meta-optimizer (every 72h)
0 0 */3 * * /path/to/scripts/meta_optimizer.py
```

---

## Marketplace Potential

The architecture supports external agent definitions:

```python
external_prompt = factory.load_external_agent("/path/to/agent.md")
context = factory.create_context_for_persona(
    session_id="ext-001",
    persona_name="custom",
    intent="Execute custom task",
    external_prompt=external_prompt
)
```

**Business Model:**
- NAR = Open source (platform)
- Agent definitions = Shareable apps
- Brain = Personal (never shared)
